B.b18=s(["Tw\xf2p demann. Tann yon ti moman epi eseye ank\xf2.","Trop de demandes. Patientez puis r\xe9essayez.","Too many requests. Wait before trying again."],t.s)
B.b9H=s(["Adr\xe8s aplikasyon Web la pa otorize sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019origine de l\u2019application Web n\u2019est pas autoris\xe9e sur le serveur.","The web application origin is not allowed by the server."],t.s)
